@startuml
skinparam participantStyle rectangular
skinparam ParticipantPadding 90
skinparam NotePadding 16

participant "Clients" as Clients
participant "Server" as Server

note right of Server
  * Initialize CryptoContext (CC)
  * Server KeyGen (skS, pkS), EvalKey parts
end note

||| 

Server -> Clients: Send CC, pkS, EvalKey parts

||| 

note left of Clients
  * MultipartyKeyGen(pkS) -> skC, pkC
  * Generate EvalKey Shares (e.g., MultiKeySwitchGen)
end note

||| 

Clients -> Server: Send pkC, EvalKey Shares

||| 

note right of Server
  * Aggregate pkC from all clients with pkS -> mpPK
  * Aggregate EvalKey Shares -> evalMultAB, etc.
end note

||| 

Server -> Clients: Send mpPK, evalMultAB

||| 

note left of Clients
  * Generate final EvalKey Share (evalMultBAB using skC, evalMultAB)
  * Save mpPK, CC
end note

||| 

Clients -> Server: Send evalMultBAB

||| 

note right of Server
  * Aggregate evalMultBAB with server's part -> final EvalMultKey
  * Insert final EvalKeys into CC
  * Hold CryptoContext in server process for follow-on workflows
end note

@enduml
